ubuntu安装OpenCV（python）环境
创建虚拟环境安装opencv
conda activate -n opencv
conda activate opencv
pip install opencv-python

进入环境运行代码
conda activate opencv
cd /home/chen/code/cam_usb_correct_python
python correct.py


windows安装OpenCV（python）环境
下载安装包
https://www.python.org/downloads/windows/
例如Python 3.10.11  Windows installer (64-bit)

创建虚拟环境安装OpenCV
python -m venv opencv
.\opencv\Scripts\activate
pip install opencv-python
验证
python
import cv2
print(cv2.__version__)

进入环境运行代码
.\opencv\Scripts\activate
cd C:\code\OpenCV\cam_usb_correct_python
python correct.py